                                "sense_id": "17e5e47d-e23a-3f05-98a4-3a5cf3634896",
                                "text": "Those which write the life of Augustus Cæsar, note this in his military discipline, that he was exceeding liberall and lavish in his gifts to such as were of any desert[…]."
